{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">郭可盈與林文龍一直恩愛如昔，婚後育有愛女林天若，一家三口幸福美滿。趁着暑假，他們一家飛到泰國布吉享受陽光與海灘，心情大好的可盈更在社交網大方分享多張度假靚相。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951903951754626614_8950740074 (1).jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026WpCzPgHbEI1785387000.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951903951754626614_8950740074 (1).jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相中可見，現年 56 歲的郭可盈多年來保養得宜，身材更是「零走樣」。其中一張相片，見可盈在床上慵懶地擺出甫士，穿上小背心加超短褲的她，大晒一雙白滑逆天長腿，盡情享受舒適的假期。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">而且，臉上完全沒留下歲月痕迹的她，難怪一直被外界狂讚是「凍齡美魔女」，狀態極勇！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904462193165413_8950740074.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026KbtAufjODG1785387000.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904462193165413_8950740074.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904496737348751_8950740074.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026fkM4nbnbu11785387000.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904496737348751_8950740074.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904309856094967_8950740074.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026P4z10i34fc1785387000.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904309856094967_8950740074.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951905039614598231_8950740074.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026MYhhvMRW9s1785386999.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951905039614598231_8950740074.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904338519969671_8950740074.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026CNiNFlY3xt1785387000.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"khy_official_1785324012_3951904338519969671_8950740074.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了個人靚相，可盈與亭亭玉立的女兒天若亦穿上充滿度假風的長裙，齊齊化身好姊妹穿「母女裝」拍下不少唯美打卡照。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另外，相片中又見到林文龍與女兒在泳池中玩得相當投入開心，隔住個 Mon 都能感受到他們一家難忘又溫馨的親子時光，實在羨煞旁人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T07:19:06.004389+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}